# StreamlineOS — Not fixed and partially fixed issues (retest 23 Oct 2026, ~22:20 IST)

Org ADitay CAhala, production, Chrome on Linux, 1280×800. **17 issues: 8 still open, 9 partially fixed.** (5 more couldn't be retested: ASKOS-002, RBAC-001, RBAC-003, RBAC-005, RBAC-007.)

