## Details (original report with the retest result added)

### MAIL-001: Sending email fails: POST https://api.streamlineos.in/mail/send blocked by CORS (net::ERR_FAILED)

**Retest status (23 Oct 22:20 IST): PARTIALLY FIXED** — Critical | The CORS block is gone. | POST `/mail/send` returns **503** (2/2) with "The mail provider did not accept the message. Try again in a moment." Mail still cannot be sent.

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| Severity | **Critical** |
| Priority | P1 |
| Status | Open — confirmed both rounds (error feedback improved in R2) |
| Evidence label | VERIFIED |
| URL | https://www.streamlineos.in/mail |
| Role | Owner (adityachalla01) |
| Browser | Chrome on Linux, 1280x800 viewport (automation-driven browser; member session in a separate Chrome profile) |
| Rounds | R1: failed 2+ attempts, no spinner, no error, Send stayed enabled. R2: failed 1/1 (retry outcome unclear); now shows "Sending…" ~8–10 s then error toast. |
| Repro rate | R1 2+/2+; R2 1/1 |

**Preconditions:** Owner signed in; mail account connected ("Account 2").

**Steps to reproduce:**
1. Open /mail → Compose.
2. To: qa.mail@example.com; Subject "QA Test"; short body.
3. Click Send; open DevTools console/network.

**Expected:** Mail is sent, appears in Sent, success toast.

**Actual:** R1: request blocked, no UI feedback. R2: "Sending…" spinner ~8–10 s then toast "Network error contacting api.streamlineos.in (POST /mail/send)… Retry"; console: CORS policy blocked https://api.streamlineos.in/mail/send, net::ERR_FAILED. Nothing in Sent.

**Evidence (textual — no screenshot files):** Exact toast and console text from R2 notes; R1 notes record CORS block and net::ERR_FAILED.

**Impact:** Users cannot send any email from StreamlineOS Mail — core function unavailable.

**Acceptance criterion:** Send to an external test address succeeds 5/5 from https://www.streamlineos.in; preflight returns correct Access-Control-Allow-Origin; message appears in Sent.

**Safe retest:** Send one message to a tester-owned mailbox (not example.com) and confirm receipt; delete from Sent.

