### CHAT-001: Live delivery/presence is unreliable: second tab not updated, header flaps to "0 online / Offline" / "Reconnecting to live chat..."

**Retest status (23 Oct 22:20 IST): PARTIALLY FIXED** — Medium | Messages cross between tabs in 1.3–2.3 s. | Presence shows "0 online / Offline" or "Reconnecting to live chat…" for about 10 s after load.

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| Severity | **Medium** |
| Priority | P2 |
| Status | Open — intermittent |
| Evidence label | INTERMITTENT |
| URL | https://www.streamlineos.in/chat?channel=7 |
| Role | Owner (adityachalla01) |
| Browser | Chrome on Linux, 1280x800 viewport (automation-driven browser; member session in a separate Chrome profile) |
| Rounds | R1: reproduced 1/1. R2: live delivery NOT REPRODUCED 0/2 (A→B and B→A in ~1 s), but presence later flapped back to "0 online / Offline" in the same session. |
| Repro rate | R1 1/1; R2 0/2 for message delivery; presence flap observed 1× in R2 |

**Preconditions:** Owner signed in; self DM (?channel=7) open in two tabs.

**Steps to reproduce:**
1. Open /chat?channel=7 in tab A and tab B.
2. Send "QA Test live A" from tab A.
3. Watch tab B without reloading for 10 s; then send from B and watch A.
4. Watch the conversation header presence text over several minutes.

**Expected:** Message appears in the other tab within ~2 s; presence text stays stable and accurate.

**Actual:** R1: tab B did not update until reload; header showed "0 online / Offline" and "Reconnecting to live chat...". R2: messages delivered within ~1 s both ways with header "1 person online / Online", but later in the session header again showed "0 online / Offline".

**Evidence (textual — no screenshot files):** Exact header strings above from R1/R2 notes. No websocket/network trace captured (INFERRED: realtime connection drops intermittently).

**Impact:** Users may miss or reply late to messages and see wrong presence; erodes trust in chat.

**Acceptance criterion:** Over 10 consecutive cross-tab sends, 10/10 arrive within 2 s without reload; presence does not show Offline while the socket is connected; if disconnected, a visible reconnect banner appears and clears on recovery.

**Safe retest:** Use only the self DM; send 10 "QA Test live n" messages between two tabs; delete them afterwards.

